notes.content:
- New Karl Skin;
- New information Window;
- Bug Fixes.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32964363/2d664861b656cd2f090f150ca90ca8a54b4c2b88.jpg[/img]
- Fixed robot enemy foot sliding in Robot Infinity mode;
- Robot animations now have some subtle variations between each other for them to look more believable;
- Fine tuned blocking detecting mechanics for the Robot Infinity mode for the blocking to feel more natural.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32964363/13062578996f3639c329968783941490ea43df32.png[/img]

= Update 25th March 2019 =

- SteamVR 2.x implemented and we've tested and fine tuned parameters for Vive, Oculus Rift and Window MR. VFC is now future ready;

- Academy Mode Bug Fix;

To ensure that the game functions as intended. VFC players please do remember to update your steamVR to the latest version and also update your firmware as per usual.

Dear community,

Happy New Year! Wishing you great success in achieving your
dreams and goals!

Here we've brought you some update on VFC

Colosseum mode Update (2nd Jan 2019)
     - Highest and total KO will now be recorded and displayed in leader-board room;
     - Entry level robot enemy implemented in the first 2 rounds for you to warm up;
     - Robots will now come into the arena from the front gate;
     - Robot difficulty slightly re-balanced; 
     - nearly 50% more sound effects added to a variety of robot animations.
